+## Décision audit
+
+```text
+CODE_CONTINUITE_AUDITE = OUI
+SOUS_ENSEMBLE_COMMITTABLE = OUI
+API_V1_ENTRYPOINT_COMMITTABLE_TEL_QUEL = NON
+```
